{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432260/extras/HWLN_upd.gif?t=1744042439\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Annotation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity lives under the despotic rule of an ancient giant. To ward off the wrath of the colossus, people make bloody sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beloved of young Elma is chosen  as a  new offering. The girl puts her own life on the line to save her lover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The will of fate<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dice will pave the way where words and blades fail. The sworn enemy will obey if fate shows you favor in the ritual game. Are you sure that luck is on your side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The non-linear narrative is complemented by mini-games based on modifications of classic dice games. Weigh the risks wisely to increase your chances of winning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In &quot;Humility&quot; you will find...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fascinating plot inspired by the stories of Lovecraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disturbing, oppressive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Noir-style graphics. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432260?t=1744042439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744042439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432260/3682090f961ad7327e44af343d0ccb1a38f1800f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744042439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432260/3682090f961ad7327e44af343d0ccb1a38f1800f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744042439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432260/extras/HWLN_upd.gif?t=1744042439\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Annotation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity lives under the despotic rule of an ancient giant. To ward off the wrath of the colossus, people make bloody sacrifices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beloved of young Elma is chosen  as a  new offering. The girl puts her own life on the line to save her lover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The will of fate<strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dice will pave the way where words and blades fail. The sworn enemy will obey if fate shows you favor in the ritual game. Are you sure that luck is on your side?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The non-linear narrative is complemented by mini-games based on modifications of classic dice games. Weigh the risks wisely to increase your chances of winning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In &quot;Humility&quot; you will find...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fascinating plot inspired by the stories of Lovecraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disturbing, oppressive atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Noir-style graphics. </p></li></ul>","developers":["Pale Dome"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432260/50c9de56dced7284ceda433aebf7d161e9a4e82e/header.jpg?t=1744042439","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Humility","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s